<title>HONG KONG: SHK Hong Kong Ind proposes name change.</title>
<headline>SHK Hong Kong Ind proposes name change.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Industrial companies investor SHK Hong Kong Industries Ltd said on Friday it has proposed changing its name to Yu Ming Investments Ltd.</p>
<p>In a statement, SHK Hong Kong said the proposed change is subject to shareholder approval in an extraordinary general meeting.</p>
<p>It gave no details on the timing of the meeting or the reason for the name change.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
